case                                         monoWall heartbeat either
real Linux suspend 60 s (mono frozen)        true     true      true
real suspend, clock that counts sleep        false    true      true
SIGSTOP 60 s (both advance)                  false    true      true
busy event loop 5 s stall                    false    true      true
clock stepped back 10 min by NTP             false    false     false
clock stepped forward 10 min by NTP          true     true      true
normal tick                                  false    false     false
